  "alternateName": [
    "dcm4chee",
    "dcm4che 5"
  ],
  "description": "The de-facto open-source Java DICOM toolkit and library, providing a comprehensive implementation of the DICOM standard for medical imaging. Ships as three complementary products: dcm4che 5 toolkit and library (core Java API), dcm4chee Archive 5 (IHE-compliant enterprise image manager and archive), and 50+ command-line utilities covering DICOM conversion (to/from JSON, XML, JPEG, PDF), network services (C-FIND, C-MOVE, C-GET), de-identification, HL7 message handling, and LDAP configuration. Runs on Linux, Windows, and macOS across multiple architectures. MPL-1.1 licensed, community-governed, with 3,500+ commits and active releases.",
  "url": "http://web.dcm4che.org/",
