  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The foundational open-source DICOM toolkit for Java environments — widely embedded in hospital PACS systems, research imaging pipelines, and clinical data platforms, often invisibly. v5.34.3 released April 2026, 1.4k stars and 696 forks reflect a specialist infrastructure library rather than a consumer tool. The dcm4chee Archive 5 component is an IHE-compliant enterprise image archive deployable in production. No viable open-source alternative exists at this depth of DICOM coverage in Java.",
